1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:14,153
Agents that raise the mutation rate are mutagens: physical ones like X rays and ultraviolet, chemical ones like mustard gas, nitrous acid and E M S, and biological ones like transposons.

2
00:00:14,153 --> 00:00:20,390
And here is why mutation matters: it is the only original source of new alleles.

3
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:24,049
Crossing over only reshuffles what already exists.

4
00:00:24,049 --> 00:00:29,960
Without mutation there is nothing for natural selection to work on, and no evolution.

